# Dogodki API — zahteve za BE sklop 2 (validacija vhoda: DTO, class-validator, pipes)
# Vse zahteve z napačnim vhodom vrnejo 400, še preden koda pride do servisa.

@base = http://localhost:3000

### ParseIntPipe: id ni število → 400 "numeric string is expected"
GET {{base}}/events/abc

### Veljaven nov dogodek → 201
POST {{base}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Večer poezije",
  "venue": "Knjižnica Otona Župančiča, Ljubljana",
  "startsAt": "2030-04-10T17:00:00.000Z",
  "capacity": 80,
  "ticketPriceCents": 0
}

### Prazno telo → 400 s seznamom vseh napak
POST {{base}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Custom validator @IsInFuture: datum v preteklosti → 400
POST {{base}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Včerajšnji koncert",
  "venue": "Kino Šiška, Ljubljana",
  "startsAt": "2020-01-01T20:00:00.000Z",
  "capacity": 100,
  "ticketPriceCents": 1500
}

### @IsInt: capacity ni celo število → 400
POST {{base}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pol sedeža",
  "venue": "Kino Šiška, Ljubljana",
  "startsAt": "2030-05-01T20:00:00.000Z",
  "capacity": 10.5,
  "ticketPriceCents": 1500
}

### @IsInt: capacity kot niz "10" → 400 (JSON telo se ne pretvarja samo)
POST {{base}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Niz namesto števila",
  "venue": "Kino Šiška, Ljubljana",
  "startsAt": "2030-05-01T20:00:00.000Z",
  "capacity": "10",
  "ticketPriceCents": 1500
}

### forbidNonWhitelisted: polje, ki ga ni v DTO → 400 "property id should not exist"
POST {{base}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Prepiši prvi dogodek",
  "venue": "Kino Šiška, Ljubljana",
  "startsAt": "2030-05-01T20:00:00.000Z",
  "capacity": 100,
  "ticketPriceCents": 1500
}

### UpdateEventDto (PartialType): eno polje → 200
PATCH {{base}}/events/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "capacity": 120 }

### UpdateEventDto: podano polje se še vedno preveri → 400
PATCH {{base}}/events/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "capacity": 0 }

### Nakup vstopnic → 201, totalCents izračuna strežnik
POST {{base}}/events/1/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 2 }

### Odjemalec poskusi poslati ceno → 400 "property totalCents should not exist"
POST {{base}}/events/1/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 2, "totalCents": 1 }

### quantity izven meja (1–10) → 400
POST {{base}}/events/1/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 11 }

### Neobstoječ dogodek → 404
POST {{base}}/events/999/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 1 }

### Razprodano → 409 Conflict (1/2): majhen dogodek s capacity 2
POST {{base}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hišni koncert",
  "venue": "Dnevna soba, Maribor",
  "startsAt": "2030-06-01T19:00:00.000Z",
  "capacity": 2,
  "ticketPriceCents": 1000
}

### Razprodano → 409 Conflict (2/2): 3 vstopnice za dogodek zgoraj
# Zamenjaj 10 z id-jem iz odgovora prejšnje zahteve.
POST {{base}}/events/10/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 3 }
